Subject: Revised Draft Decision Re: Suspension of Direct Access



Attached is the revised draft decision of ALJ Barnett in A.98-07-003 et al.
This draft decision is on the Commission's September 6, 2001 agenda.

Comments are to be filed on September 4, 2001 by 5:00 pm.  However, an
electronic version must be served no later than 10:00 am on that date to
those persons who have electronic addresses.

Appendix A of the draft decision is the June 12, 2001 three page memo to
"Interested Parties--DWR Power Purchase Program" from the State Treasurer,
Dept. of Finance, and DWR.  That document in PDF format will be available
shortly at the Commission's website, along with the revised draft decision.


John S. Wong
ALJ - CPUC
<<Formatted Direct Access DD.doc>>


